es. Critical shared-world consistency defect.\\\\n5. Network review: player seat 0 and the host hero were skipped by PvP ray damage. Fixed explicit remote-id checks and host damage dispatch. Critical multiplayer combat defect.\\\\n';p.write_text(s)\nPY\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
