frameYP([6,-3,-1],Math.PI/2+Math.sin(S.time*.5)*.2,.05,-.1),S.shopIds[S.shopIndex],{cond:1},.4);return;}\\\\n if(tool==='monocular')\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('test/browser_checks.py');s=p.read_text().replace(\\\"__game.S.tool=null;__game.game.pause()\\\", \\\"__game.S.tool=null;__game.game.pause();__game.game.advance(.02,{draw:true})\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\"q.S.card=null;q.S.tool=null;q.S.bound=false;\\\", \\\"q.S.card=null;q.S.subtitle=null;q.S.tool=null;q.S.bound=false;\\\")\np.write_text(s)\np=Path('test/ISSUES.md');p.write_text(p.read_text()+'\\\\n14. Visual inspection: held map/card was clipped below the screen and subtitles obscured its notes. Raised and reduced the paper, and hide duplicate subtitles while reading held objects. Noncritical readability defect.\\\\n15. Menu review: the shared camera captured the mouse on title clicks; disable pointer capture on menus and restore it in play. Noncritical input defect.\\\\n16. Idle-menu review: a paused Settings screen blocked title-scene attract timing. Added a wall-clock idle check that closes title menus and starts the reel, including on touch-only devices. Noncritical attract requirement defect.\\\\n')\nPY\nnode build.mjs\npython3 test/run.py --suite browser\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
