{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_114","type":"agent_message","text":"The combined run passed 71 of 72 checks; the failure was a phone-notice check sampling before startup finished. I’ve corrected that wait and added direct multiplayer combat checks. I also found that nearby patrols could attack during the restrained opening, so I’m protecting those scripted moments and testing the opening without god mode.\n"}}
