{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_131","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Release verification\n- Opening without god mode, the complete campaign, all endings, network banking/combat/fire, WebGL/WebGPU, browser UI and replay checks have passed.\n- The controller About scroll fix passed the updated rendered/UI suite: **37/37**.\n- Final issue ledger and embedded interview: **27 corrected implementation issues, 11 considered critical**. Shared-machine process terminations and test timing/fixture mistakes are excluded.\n- Native engine checkout and scratch scripts have been removed. Vendor licenses are embedded in the standalone file and retained with development sources. HTML session client remains byte-for-byte unchanged.\n- No more game changes planned. Final full command is running as session 607-final (see most recent tool session id); expected 78 checks. Preserve successful \"'`test/final-report.json`, validate final package hash and JSON, and mark this progress file complete.\nEOF\npython3 - <<'\"'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,hashlib\nroot=Path.cwd().parent;p=root/(Path.cwd().name+'.html');d=json.loads(Path('test/package-report.json').read_text());d.update(bytes=p.stat().st_size,sha256=hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest());Path('test/package-report.json').write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2))\na=json.loads((root/'exit-interview.json').read_text());assert len(a['testingFeedback'])==4 and len(a['engineFeedback'])==6 and len(a['promptFeedback'])==4\nassert '27 distinct' in a['testingFeedback'][0]\nassert a['sourceInformation']['usage']=='added on import'\nassert not Path('engine-repo').exists()\nprint('Final interview, standalone package and cleaned development tree validated.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
